sequenceDiagram
  participant W as Workflow
  participant T as Temporal
  participant S as Syntara activity worker
  participant R as Installed registry
  participant E as Execution Plane
  participant P as Isolated pod
  participant X as Allowed external API

  W->>T: Run pinned step revision
  T->>S: Generic Container activity with pinned IDs
  S->>R: Resolve revision, policy, integration and credentials

  alt Kind A: GitHub Create issue
    R-->>S: Platform HTTP runner digest plus declarative mapping
  else Kind B: Custom risk scorer
    R-->>S: Plugin-owned image digest plus workload ABI
  end

  S->>E: Submit server-generated work item
  E->>P: Start pinned image with effective grant
  P->>X: Request through approved egress path
  X-->>P: Response
  P-->>E: ABI result and heartbeat
  E-->>S: Durable terminal result
  S-->>T: Typed activity result
  T-->>W: Continue to the next node
